#: templates/storefront/about.html:15
msgid "Who we are?"
msgstr "Qui sommes-nous ?"

#: templates/storefront/about.html:19
msgid ""
"We're Marco Sandelgård and Milo Sandelgård Bascoulergue, two cousins who "
"grew up in Chamonix with one foot in France and one in Sweden."
msgstr ""
"Nous sommes Marco Sandelgård et Milo Sandelgård Bascoulergue, deux cousins "
"qui ont grandi à Chamonix, un pied en France et l'autre en Suède."

#: templates/storefront/about.html:20
msgid ""
"In Sweden, sweets mean lösgodis: a wall of loose candy, a paper bag, and the "
"serious business of choosing exactly what goes in it. Sour strips, salty "
"liquorice, fruity jellies, chocolate. Everyone has their own mix."
msgstr ""
"En Suède, les bonbons, c'est le lösgodis : un mur de bonbons en vrac, un "
"sachet en papier, et l'affaire sérieuse de choisir exactement ce qu'on y "
"met. Lanières acidulées, réglisse salée, gommes aux fruits, chocolat. Chacun "
"a son propre mélange."

#: templates/storefront/about.html:21
msgid ""
"We missed it in France. So we started SwedeSweets to bring the real thing "
"here: the Swedish pick & mix we grew up with, straight from Sweden."
msgstr ""
"Ça nous manquait en France. Alors nous avons créé SwedeSweets pour apporter "
"ici le vrai : les bonbons suédois en vrac de notre enfance, directement de "
"Suède."

#: templates/storefront/about.html:24
msgid "Come and make your own bag."
msgstr "Venez composer votre propre sachet."

#: templates/storefront/about.html:30
msgid ""
"A handful of our sweets held up in the snow, high above the clouds in the "
"mountains."
msgstr ""
"Une poignée de nos bonbons tenue dans la neige, bien au-dessus des nuages, "
"en montagne."

#: templates/storefront/cart.html:21
